# Get Care must not touch authentication

Changes to `src/pages/GetCarePage.tsx` must not modify the authentication check in `src/App.tsx`.

The signed-in gate is `medplum.getProfile()` in `src/App.tsx`. Leave it alone.

Hours, eligibility, slot filtering, and booking rules belong in `GetCarePage.tsx` (`fetchAppointments`, pre-`BaseScheduler` guards, `holdAppointment`) — not in `App.tsx`.

```tsx
// BAD — mixing scheduling work with the login gate
if (!medplum.getProfile() || !patient.isEligible) { ... }

// GOOD — keep App.tsx as profile-present vs not; put booking policy in GetCarePage.tsx
if (!medplum.getProfile()) {
  return <PublicRoutes />;
}
```
